 ## Layout
 
 See `docs/02_ARCHITECTURE.md`. Specs in `docs/`. Decisions taken during the build in `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
+
+### Daily context health (October 13 repair)
+
+Intraday sessions retain selected stocks whose prior-session daily data fails,
+report sanitized `daily_bars` errors in heartbeats, and retry those stocks at most
+once per poll. Healthy contexts are reused. Exits run before retries; entries
+require a valid daily context. A valid empty scanner selection is still healthy.
+If errors remain when a session finishes, its final heartbeat remains failed.
+Install the source repair after bot commands finish; do not restart an active
+session or reset paper account history to clear a heartbeat.
